    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75860" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὖλος</span></b>  (C), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀλοός</span>
			, <i>destructive, baneful, cruel</i>, epith. of Ares, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				5.461
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				717
			</span></i>; of Achilles, <i><span class="en">
				21.536
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χεῖμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Bion
					15.14
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στόμιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					233
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὖλος Ὄνειρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					2.6
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				8
			</span></i>; <i>cruel</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἔρως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					3.297
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				1078
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὖλον κεκλήγοντες</span>, of the
				<i>death-cry</i> of birds flying from the hawk, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				17.756
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				759
			</span></i> (but 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὖλος</span>
			 (B) <i><span class="en">
				3
			</span></i> fin.); so later 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὖλον γεράνων νέφος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.543
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὖλον ἀείδειν</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				27
			</span></i> (Antip. Sid.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνυζηθμὸν κυνὸς οὖλον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					671
				</span></i>
			.</div>
